@startuml
title Organize by Topic Sequence (/api/personal-topics/*)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Organize by Topic UI" as TopicUi
control "WordSearchApiService\n(FE Mobile)" as SearchApiService
control "WordDetailApiService\n(FE Mobile)" as DetailApiService
entity "PersonalTopicSummaryDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FePersonalTopicDto
entity "WordSummaryDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordSummaryDto
entity "PersonalTopicResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BePersonalTopicDto
entity "ListWordResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeListWordDto
entity "AddPersonalTopicWordRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as BeAddTopicWordDto
control "PersonalTopicsController\n(BE API)" as PersonalTopicsController
control "PersonalTopicQueryService" as TopicQueryService
control "PersonalTopicMutationService" as TopicMutationService
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordSense" as WordSenseEntity
entity "WordTopic" as WordTopicEntity
entity "UserList" as UserListEntity
entity "UserListWord" as UserListWordEntity
control "PersonalTopicQueryRepository" as TopicQueryRepository
control "PersonalTopicMutationRepository" as TopicMutationRepository
control "ListMutationRepository" as ListRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over TopicUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Mobile services exist: WordSearchApiService and WordDetailApiService.
FE response DTOs exist: PersonalTopicSummaryDto and WordSummaryDto.
BE request DTO exists: AddPersonalTopicWordRequest.
BE response DTOs exist: PersonalTopicResponse and ListWordResponse.
Endpoints are GET /api/personal-topics, GET /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words,
POST /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words and DELETE /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words/{wordId}.
Entities exist: Topic, Word, WordSense, WordTopic, UserList and UserListWord.
end note

Learner -> TopicUi: Open topic organization
TopicUi -> SearchApiService: getPersonalTopics(wordId?)
SearchApiService -> PersonalTopicsController: GET /api/personal-topics\nwordId?
PersonalTopicsController -> PersonalTopicsController: Check authenticated user
PersonalTopicsController -> TopicQueryService: GetTopicsAsync(userId, query)
TopicQueryService -> TopicQueryRepository: GetTopicsAsync(userId, wordId?)
TopicQueryRepository -> DbContext: Query topics and reserved lists
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics,\nSELECT user_lists and user_list_words
MySQL --> DbContext: Topic/list rows
DbContext -> TopicEntity: Read Topic rows
DbContext -> UserListEntity: Read reserved UserList rows
DbContext -> UserListWordEntity: Count/check UserListWord rows
TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic rows
UserListEntity --> DbContext: Personal topic lists
UserListWordEntity --> DbContext: Word counts and contains flag
DbContext --> TopicQueryRepository: Personal topic summaries
TopicQueryRepository --> TopicQueryService: Personal topics
TopicQueryService --> PersonalTopicsController: Topic result
PersonalTopicsController -> BePersonalTopicDto: Create PersonalTopicResponse list
BePersonalTopicDto --> PersonalTopicsController: PersonalTopicResponse list
PersonalTopicsController --> SearchApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nPersonalTopicResponse list
SearchApiService -> FePersonalTopicDto: Parse response data
FePersonalTopicDto --> SearchApiService: PersonalTopicSummary list
SearchApiService --> TopicUi: Show topics

opt View words in a topic
    TopicUi -> SearchApiService: getPersonalTopicWords(topicId)
    SearchApiService -> PersonalTopicsController: GET /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words\npage, limit
    PersonalTopicsController -> TopicQueryService: GetWordsAsync(userId, topicId, query)
    TopicQueryService -> TopicQueryRepository: GetTopicWordsAsync(userId, topicId, page, limit)
    TopicQueryRepository -> DbContext: Query reserved list words
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics,\nSELECT user_lists,\nSELECT user_list_words JOIN words
    MySQL --> DbContext: Topic/list/word rows
    DbContext -> TopicEntity: Check Topic
    DbContext -> UserListEntity: Read reserved UserList
    DbContext -> UserListWordEntity: Read UserListWord rows
    DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word rows
    DbContext -> WordSenseEntity: Read primary WordSense
    TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic exists
    UserListEntity --> DbContext: List id or null
    UserListWordEntity --> DbContext: List word rows
    WordEntity --> DbContext: Word rows
    WordSenseEntity --> DbContext: Primary meaning
    DbContext --> TopicQueryRepository: Paged topic words
    TopicQueryRepository --> TopicQueryService: Paged words
    TopicQueryService --> PersonalTopicsController: Words result
    PersonalTopicsController -> BeListWordDto: Create ListWordResponse list
    BeListWordDto --> PersonalTopicsController: ListWordResponse list
    PersonalTopicsController --> SearchApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nListWordResponse list
    SearchApiService -> FeWordSummaryDto: Parse response data
    FeWordSummaryDto --> SearchApiService: WordSummary list
    SearchApiService --> TopicUi: Show topic words
end

opt Add word to personal topic
    TopicUi -> DetailApiService: addWordToPersonalTopic(topicId, wordId, note?)
    DetailApiService -> PersonalTopicsController: POST /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words\nword_id, note
    PersonalTopicsController -> BeAddTopicWordDto: Bind request body
    BeAddTopicWordDto --> PersonalTopicsController: AddPersonalTopicWordRequest
    PersonalTopicsController -> TopicMutationService: AddWordAsync(userId, topicId, request)
    TopicMutationService -> TopicMutationRepository: TopicExistsAsync(topicId)
    TopicMutationRepository -> DbContext: Check Topic
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics
    MySQL --> DbContext: Topic exists or not
    DbContext -> TopicEntity: Read Topic?
    TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic or null
    TopicMutationRepository --> TopicMutationService: Exists result

    alt Topic or word invalid
        TopicMutationService --> PersonalTopicsController: NotFound or validation failure
        PersonalTopicsController --> DetailApiService: HTTP 400/404 error
        DetailApiService --> TopicUi: Show add error
    else Topic and word valid
        TopicMutationService -> TopicMutationRepository: WordBelongsToTopicAsync(topicId, wordId)
        TopicMutationRepository -> DbContext: Check WordTopic link
        DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT word_topics
        MySQL --> DbContext: Link exists or not
        DbContext -> WordTopicEntity: Read WordTopic?
        WordTopicEntity --> DbContext: WordTopic or null
        TopicMutationService -> TopicMutationRepository: GetOrCreateListIdAsync(userId, topicId)
        TopicMutationRepository -> DbContext: Find or create reserved UserList
        DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT/INSERT user_lists
        MySQL --> DbContext: List result
        DbContext -> UserListEntity: Read/create UserList
        UserListEntity --> DbContext: UserList
        TopicMutationService -> ListRepository: AddWordAsync or RestoreWordAsync
        ListRepository -> UserListWordEntity: Create or restore UserListWord
        UserListWordEntity --> ListRepository: UserListWord
        ListRepository -> DbContext: Add/track UserListWord
        DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT/UPDATE user_list_words
        MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
        TopicMutationService --> PersonalTopicsController: Personal topic result
        PersonalTopicsController -> BePersonalTopicDto: Create PersonalTopicResponse
        BePersonalTopicDto --> PersonalTopicsController: PersonalTopicResponse
        PersonalTopicsController --> DetailApiService: HTTP 201 Created\nPersonalTopicResponse
        DetailApiService -> FePersonalTopicDto: Parse response data
        FePersonalTopicDto --> DetailApiService: PersonalTopicSummary
        DetailApiService --> TopicUi: Show topic updated
    end
end

opt Remove word from personal topic
    TopicUi -> SearchApiService: removePersonalTopicWord(topicId, wordId)
    SearchApiService -> PersonalTopicsController: DELETE /api/personal-topics/{topicId}/words/{wordId}
    PersonalTopicsController -> TopicMutationService: RemoveWordAsync(userId, topicId, wordId)
    TopicMutationService -> TopicMutationRepository: FindActiveListIdAsync(userId, topicId)
    TopicMutationRepository -> DbContext: Query reserved UserList
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_lists
    MySQL --> DbContext: List id or null
    DbContext -> UserListEntity: Read UserList?
    UserListEntity --> DbContext: UserList or null
    TopicMutationService -> ListRepository: RemoveWordAsync(userId, listId, wordId)
    ListRepository -> DbContext: Find UserListWord
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_list_words
    MySQL --> DbContext: UserListWord row or null
    DbContext -> UserListWordEntity: Read UserListWord?
    UserListWordEntity --> DbContext: UserListWord or null
    ListRepository -> UserListWordEntity: Set status deleted
    UserListWordEntity --> ListRepository: UserListWord updated
    ListRepository -> DbContext: Save changes
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE user_list_words
    MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
    TopicMutationService --> PersonalTopicsController: Success result
    PersonalTopicsController --> SearchApiService: HTTP 200 OK
    SearchApiService --> TopicUi: Show topic updated
end

@enduml
